<title>CHINA: TENNIS-SOUTH KOREA LEAD CHINA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SOUTH KOREA LEAD CHINA 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea led China 2-0 after Friday's opening singles in their Davis Cup Asia/Oceania zone group one, second round tie.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Lee Hyung-taik beat Xia Jiaping 6-1 2-6 2-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-1</p>
<p>Yoon Yong-il beat Pan Bin 6-3 6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
